    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage every function of the rig, from resource extraction and equipment maintenance to ensuring the crew's safety. Your decisions have real consequences \u2013 will you handle a malfunction on your own, or call for help?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/43173ecdb4ccb9a505a1f4847586f248.poster.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/43173ecdb4ccb9a505a1f4847586f248.webm?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/43173ecdb4ccb9a505a1f4847586f248.mp4?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each day brings new challenges: changing weather conditions, equipment failures, and unexpected crises. With a first-person perspective, you\u2019ll experience every aspect of life on the rig firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/623d23b480072d98c66891b6d59d9c75.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/3d71d87c639548e25ec502fc1d68d0fc.poster.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/3d71d87c639548e25ec502fc1d68d0fc.webm?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/3d71d87c639548e25ec502fc1d68d0fc.mp4?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your platform, upgrade equipment, and take care of your crew to ensure smooth operations in the harsh conditions of the open sea. The day-night cycle and realistically simulated weather conditions mean that every decision matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/8ded9a8cb5ac6b0cf6b9964801fbcdbf.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/cc12c73cf00ace68e2793d0528ddab8a.poster.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/cc12c73cf00ace68e2793d0528ddab8a.webm?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/cc12c73cf00ace68e2793d0528ddab8a.mp4?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide range of tools and techniques to tackle problems \u2013 from minor repairs to complex rescue operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/740ac2546d252b6cd3618f27e2d33eb5.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/146d297a479f37695ff397ea722673ce.poster.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/146d297a479f37695ff397ea722673ce.webm?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/146d297a479f37695ff397ea722673ce.mp4?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face life on an oil rig? Show that you can handle the challenges this job brings. You decide how your story unfolds on the open sea.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage every function of the rig, from resource extraction and equipment maintenance to ensuring the crew's safety. Your decisions have real consequences \u2013 will you handle a malfunction on your own, or call for help?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/43173ecdb4ccb9a505a1f4847586f248.poster.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/43173ecdb4ccb9a505a1f4847586f248.webm?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/43173ecdb4ccb9a505a1f4847586f248.mp4?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each day brings new challenges: changing weather conditions, equipment failures, and unexpected crises. With a first-person perspective, you\u2019ll experience every aspect of life on the rig firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/623d23b480072d98c66891b6d59d9c75.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/3d71d87c639548e25ec502fc1d68d0fc.poster.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/3d71d87c639548e25ec502fc1d68d0fc.webm?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/3d71d87c639548e25ec502fc1d68d0fc.mp4?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your platform, upgrade equipment, and take care of your crew to ensure smooth operations in the harsh conditions of the open sea. The day-night cycle and realistically simulated weather conditions mean that every decision matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/8ded9a8cb5ac6b0cf6b9964801fbcdbf.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/cc12c73cf00ace68e2793d0528ddab8a.poster.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/cc12c73cf00ace68e2793d0528ddab8a.webm?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/cc12c73cf00ace68e2793d0528ddab8a.mp4?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide range of tools and techniques to tackle problems \u2013 from minor repairs to complex rescue operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/740ac2546d252b6cd3618f27e2d33eb5.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/146d297a479f37695ff397ea722673ce.poster.avif?t=1743680813\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/146d297a479f37695ff397ea722673ce.webm?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251540/extras/146d297a479f37695ff397ea722673ce.mp4?t=1743680813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face life on an oil rig? Show that you can handle the challenges this job brings. You decide how your story unfolds on the open sea.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome aboard the oil rig, where daily challenges await around every corner. In this realistic simulation, you take on the role of an operator of one of the most technologically advanced structures in the world. This isn\u2019t just a workplace \u2013 it\u2019s your new life at sea.",
